[2.4, "o", "goal: Add a --json flag to the invoice CLI, with a parser module and tests\r\nadmission: 6 of 10 fixture routes admitted\r\n  drop auto/best-coding           DISCOVERED  opaque_route\r\n  drop demo-busy/juniper-coder    AVAILABLE   provider_rate_limited\r\n  drop demo-free/hazel-coder      HEALTHY     model_unavailable\r\n  drop demo-orphan/gum-coder      ENTITLED    no_connection_evidence\r\n"]
[2.853, "o", "[GOAL] Add a --json flag to the invoice CLI, with a parser module and tests\r\n[UNDERSTAND] goal_chars=68 risk=unknown scope=repo: invoice-repo proof=node verification, integration barrier, independent review\r\n[PLAN] planning on demo-sub/atlas-coder\r\n[WORKERS] controller HEALTHY plan produced\r\n[WORKERS] run decision_signals\r\n[DAG] 3 node(s) in 2 layer(s) (PARALLEL_WORK_UNITS)\r\n[WORKERS] run decision_signals_context_budget\r\n[PLAN] topology PARALLEL_WORK_UNITS max_parallel=2\r\n[SELECT] parser ladder discovered=9 entitled=8 healthy=1 available=1 eligible=1\r\n[SELECT] parser -> demo-sub/atlas-coder (subscription, rank 0)\r\n[SELECT] cli_flag ladder discovered=9 entitled=8 healthy=1 available=1 eligible=1\r\n[SELECT] cli_flag -> demo-sub/atlas-coder (subscription, rank 0)\r\n[WORKERS] parser dispatch demo-sub/atlas-coder attempt 1\r\n[WORKERS] parser terminal failed on demo-sub/atlas-coder in 0s\r\n[FAILURE/REASSIGN] parser quota_exhausted -> REROUTE on demo-sub/atlas-coder\r\n[QUOTA/COOLDOWN] demo-sub (provider) quota_exhausted until 2026-09-29T03:19:16+00:00\r\n[WORKERS] cli_flag dispatch demo-sub/atlas-coder attempt 1\r\n[WORKERS] cli_flag terminal failed on demo-sub/atlas-coder in 0s\r\n[FAILURE/REASSIGN] cli_flag no_final_answer -> REROUTE on demo-sub/atlas-coder\r\n[QUOTA/COOLDOWN] demo-sub/atlas-coder (route) no_final_answer until 2026-09-29T01:24:16+00:00\r\n[SELECT] parser ladder discovered=9 entitled=8 healthy=2 available=1 eligible=1\r\n[SELECT] parser -> demo-free/birch-coder (free, rank 0)\r\n[FAILURE/REASSIGN] parser demo-sub/atlas-coder -> demo-free/birch-coder (quota_exhausted)\r\n[SELECT] cli_flag ladder discovered=9 entitled=8 healthy=3 available=2 eligible=2\r\n[SELECT] cli_flag -> demo-free/cedar-coder (free, rank 0)\r\n[FAILURE/REASSIGN] cli_flag demo-sub/atlas-coder -> demo-free/cedar-coder (no_final_answer)\r\n[WORKERS] parser dispatch demo-free/birch-coder attempt 2"]
